<title>SOUTH KOREA: Kyong Dong City Gas ends up on debut.</title>
<headline>Kyong Dong City Gas ends up on debut.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Kyong Dong City Gas Co Ltd, which began trading for the first time on Friday, ended the day higher, the Korea Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Kyong Dong's shares ended at 43,200 won, up 3,200 won. Its base price was 40,000 won.</p>
<p>Volume was thin, with only 10 shares exchanging hands.</p>
<p>Kyong Dong's initial public offering price had been set at 29,000 won.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
